{"title":"2010 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/0/4500c2a97f5911e5cdfd0d547cb79ca41ebe8efd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 3 \\times 4 + 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"114\" height=\"15\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/f/44f55a1367c4d96a2feef6be474f97446a443566.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 24 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 60 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 70 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 19 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Following <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/7/aa7a89b4d059d10926cd6e9fa7a868dfd900ac06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 3 \\times 4 + 10 = 2 + 12 + 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"228\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/0/4e0b3a4354935fa3fa461695ac64b96138899c6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=14 + 10 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"169\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table